# PantryCraft

**Android 14+ (SDK 34–36)** | **Kotlin 2.0+ / Jetpack Compose** | **100% Local-First & Zero Telemetry**

> A minimalist, privacy-centric Android application that recognizes pantry/fridge ingredients via camera and speech, manages inventory locally with zero telemetry, and synthesizes portion-accurate recipes using on-device models or user-provided API keys.

---

## Codebase Scaffolding & Package Information

- **Application ID & Namespace:** `com.jeffers.pantrycraft`
- **Application Label:** `PantryCraft`
- **Architecture:** Single-module Jetpack Compose app with Material 3, Room database (`pantry_items`, `grocery_items`), low-stock query, and working Home/Pantry/Grocery navigation.
- **Incremental Evolution:** Non-destructive Room migration (v1 → v2) adding storage locations (Pantry/Fridge/Freezer) and expiration timestamps, upgrading DAOs to reactive `Flow`, integrating CameraX barcode/snapshot recognition into `PantryItem.barcode`, and adding AI culinary synthesis.

