## Build & Run

```bash
# 1. Run unit test suite
./gradlew testDebugUnitTest

# 2. Assemble debug APK
./gradlew :app:assembleDebug

# 3. Output APK location
# app/build/outputs/apk/debug/app-debug.apk
```
